    "preamble": "M/S.Oriental Trade Linkers vs Union Of India on 16 July, 2019 Author: M.S.Ramesh Bench: M.S.Ramesh 1 In The High Court Of Judicature Of Madras Dated: 16.07.2019 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice M.S.Ramesh W.P.No.7108 of 2009 and M.P.No.1 of 2009 M/s.Oriental Trade Linkers, 18/B, Street No.7, Friends Colony, Shadhara, Delhi - 110095. ... Petition Vs 1. Union of India, Rep. by its Secretary to Government of India, Department of Revenue, Ministry of Finance, North Block, New Delhi. 2. The Commissioner of Customs(Seaport), No.60, Rajaji Salai, Chennai - 600001. 3. The Director General of Health Services, Ministry of Health and Family Welfare, New Delhi. 4. The Director, Central Food Laboratory, Mysore - 20. 5. The Central Committee for Food Standards, Rep. by its Secretary, Ministry of Health and Family Welfare, New Delhi. http://www.judis.nic.in6. The Port Health Officer, Chennai. ... Responde M/S.Oriental Trade Linkers vs Union Of India on 16 July, 2019 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/199914588/ 1 2 PRAYER: Writ Petition filed under Article 226 of the Constitution praying to issue a writ of Mandamus, forbearing the respondents fr detaining the consignments of betel nuts imported by the petitione subjecting them to tests under the Prevention of Food Adulteration 1954 and for quality purposes under the Prevention of Food Adulter Rules, 1955 and further direct the respondents to release the cons of betel nuts imported by the petitioner forthwith without further",
